[[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Disconnect and remove the turbocharger air inlet pipe to the\nturbocharger.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2015061.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit  the turbocharger air inlet pipe to\nthe turbocharger.</p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen the bands (1a) and remove the air intake pipe to the turbocharger\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069043.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place in its seating the air inlet pipe\nto the turbocharger and tighten the bands.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Loosen the bands and remove the air inlet hose to the turbocharger.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069479.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the turbocharger air inlet hose in\nits seating and secure it using the bands.</p>"]]